# Writeable paths whitelist
# This file uses .gitignore-style patterns to specify which files and
# directories the application is permitted to write to.

# Story node markdown files (initial node and all choice branches)
story/0.md
story/*.md

# Story media assets (images and audio for all nodes)
story/*.png
story/*.wav

# Persistent world-building and style reference files
story/world_facts.md
story/image_style.md
story/audio_style.md

# Application stylesheet
style.css
